server).
2. Type your comment into the textarea and click Submit (or press Ctrl/Cmd+Enter).
3. Comments will appear immediately below the form and remain stored in your browser.
4. Use Delete to remove individual comments, Clear all to remove everything, or Export JSON to download 
all comments.

Next steps (optional):
- Remove persistence (if you prefer memory-only behavior).
- Add additional fields (name, email), or change styling/layout for supervisors.

File location: /workspace/feedback.html

